OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Fsome showery rain will soon clear the
OL,7,Fsouth this evening, allowing dry and
OL,8,Fincreasingly clear conditions to
OL,9,Fspread south to all areas through the
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA dry, bright day with plenty
OL,13,Fof warm sunny spells. Sunshine will
OL,14,Fturn a little hazy at times through
OL,15,Fthe afternoon.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,18,Fwarm or very warm period with a good
OL,19,Fdeal of dry and bright weather. Dry on
OL,20,FTuesday. Just the risk of a few
OL,21,Fshowers on Wednesday and Thursday
